      "effect_text": {
        "en": {
          "plain": "This card cannot be nullified.\n[Counter] Choose and use one of the following two. You may only cast \"Midnight Shadow \"Re:S\"\" once per turn.\n• For this turn, the next damage you take by an attack becomes 0, and the next damage you take by your opponent's card effects becomes 0.\n• Destroy up to one card on the field, and your opponent drops a hand card.",
